! Step-2 crash test, A6 (2026-11-23): dbgA (H_B on, the field-aligned
! conduction) with the slope-limited conduction (cond_limiter = 'mc', Sharma
! & Hammett 2007), 1200 steps (past the crash at 811660), the box on the
! crash column with the operators' increments every step from 811600.
! A5 showed the unlimited conduction draining one cell below its neighbours.
! Run with mhd047_cpl_nohb_mc in one job: tools/job.stampede3_seq.
&cz3d
  grid_file = 'data/grid_atm20.dat', init_file = 'data/init_wind20_dip_m600.dat', n_r_cells = 560
